NAME
       setdns - show or set the DNS server

SYNOPSIS
       setdns
       setdns <address>

DESCRIPTION
       With no argument, prints /etc/resolv.conf and the server DHCP
       supplied. With an argument, writes that address to
       /etc/resolv.conf as the nameserver.

FILES
       /etc/resolv.conf

SEE ALSO
       nslookup(1), ifconfig(1)
